   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Measurement Specialist »gemini« </h3> <h1> Simple Measurement of Crankshaft Milling Cutters and Turning/Broaching Tools </h1>",
   "body": "<p><strong>Adjust crankshaft cutters and turning/broaching tools quickly, conveniently, and accurately—no problem with the »gemini« presetting and measuring machine. »gemini« measures 120 cutting edges in just 80 seconds—and it is as simple as it gets.</strong></p> <p>The globally unique, fully automatic measurement in »focus 360i« measuring mode is a highlight of the proven ZOLLER »pilot 3.0« image processing system—plus, the high-precision measuring sensor for runout compensation eliminates the need for complex measuring setups. This allows you to benefit from the highest quality of your workpieces, increased productivity, and comprehensive documentation. You’ll also enjoy an ergonomic workplace where tools can be easily adjusted and automatically measured and checked.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/company/contact\">Inquire now</a></p>",
